## PlanningWorkspace

Location: `<workspace>\PlanningWorkspace\`

Contains full clones of all repos, always on main branch. Updated before planning phases.

**See `PlanningWorkspace\CLAUDE.md` for repo URLs and tech details.**

**Rules:**
- READ ONLY - never modify files
- Never switch branches
- Never commit or push

